        "sendTo": "shubham.kumar11.meet@gmail.com",
        "subject": "Human Escalation due to low confidence score or high amount.",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #ecf0f1; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Action Required: Invoice Approval</h2>\n    <p>A new invoice requires manual review. This escalation was triggered because either the AI confidence score is below 0.8, or the amount exceeds ₹50,000.</p>\n    \n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; background-color: #f9f9f9; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold; width: 35%;\">Vendor</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('2. Extractor - Parse Invoice Fields').item.json.output.vendor }}</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">Ticket ID</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('2. Extractor - Parse Invoice Fields').item.json.output.ticket_id }}</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">Amount (INR)</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; color: #e74c3c; font-weight: bold;\">₹ {{ $('2. Extractor - Parse Invoice Fields').item.json.output.amount_inr }}</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">AI Confidence</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('2. Extractor - Parse Invoice Fields').item.json.output.confidence }} / 1.0</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: bold;\">GSTIN</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">{{ $('2. Extractor - Parse Invoice Fields').item.json.output.gstin }}</td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <a href=\"{{ $execution.resumeUrl }}&decision=yes\" style=\"background-color: #27ae60; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; margin-right: 15px;\">✅ APPROVE & PAY</a>\n        <a href=\"{{ $execution.resumeUrl }}&decision=no\" style=\"background-color: #c0392b; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\">❌ REJECT</a>\n    </div>\n</div>",
